---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="A Cameroonian law firm built for cross-border work, admitted in Cameroon and Nigeria, working in English and French.">
<div>
  <section style="max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,104px) clamp(20px,5vw,80px) clamp(40px,5vw,64px)">
    <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#007EA7;margin-bottom:28px">About the firm</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;max-width:24ch">A Cameroonian firm built for cross-border work</h1>
  </section>
  <hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.14);margin:0" />
  <section style="max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(40px,5vw,72px) clamp(20px,5vw,80px)">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px">
      <div style="grid-column:span 4;min-width:220px">
        <div style="display:grid;gap:26px">
          <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:14px"><div style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1">Douala · Buea</div><div style="font-size:13.5px;color:#4a5a61;margin-top:6px">Offices</div></div>
          <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:14px"><div style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1">Cameroon · Nigeria</div><div style="font-size:13.5px;color:#4a5a61;margin-top:6px">Bar admissions</div></div>
          <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:14px"><div style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1">English · French</div><div style="font-size:13.5px;color:#4a5a61;margin-top:6px">Working languages</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="grid-column:span 7;min-width:280px">
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#28383f;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:68ch;text-wrap:pretty">Abunaw &amp; Associates is a Cameroonian law firm advising businesses, organisations and individuals from offices in Douala and Buea. Our lawyers are admitted in Cameroon and Nigeria, and we act in English and French.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#28383f;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:68ch;text-wrap:pretty">Cameroon applies common law in the Northwest and Southwest regions and civil law elsewhere, while the OHADA Uniform Acts and CEMAC regulations govern much of commercial life nationwide. Our clients need counsel who can work across those systems, in both languages, without losing meaning between them.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#28383f;margin:0 0 0px;max-width:68ch;text-wrap:pretty">Our practice runs from corporate structuring, commercial transactions and compliance to succession, land, employment, family and criminal matters. Clients deal directly with the lawyer handling their matter from first instruction to conclusion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section data-reveal="1" style="max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,56px) clamp(20px,5vw,80px) clamp(56px,7vw,96px)">
    <div class="grid-4" style="display:grid;gap:clamp(28px,3vw,44px)">
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Two legal traditions</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">Lawyers who work in common law and civil law, and in OHADA and CEMAC law, rather than translating between them.</p></div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Two jurisdictions</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">Admissions in Cameroon and Nigeria, for clients whose business or family spans both.</p></div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Plain advice</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">A clear view first, then the reasoning. Clients making decisions need the answer before the authorities.</p></div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Legal education</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">Through <em>The Law Demystified</em>, the firm’s founder makes legal concepts accessible to a wider audience.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Base>
